{"text": "El Sol empezó a iluminar suavemente el sendero. Las nubes se apartaron y el aire se volvió agradable. El viajero dejó de encogerse. Primero aflojó el cuello del abrigo y luego caminó con los brazos más relajados. Viajero: Ahora se está mucho mejor.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.345374, "from": 0, "to": 2}, {"start": 0.360125, "end": 0.596416, "from": 3, "to": 6}, {"start": 0.611208, "end": 1.083791, "from": 7, "to": 13}, {"start": 1.098541, "end": 1.172374, "from": 14, "to": 15}, {"start": 1.187166, "end": 1.807457, "from": 16, "to": 24}, {"start": 1.822208, "end": 2.560624, "from": 25, "to": 35}, {"start": 2.575416, "end": 2.664041, "from": 36, "to": 38}, {"start": 2.678791, "end": 3.313832, "from": 39, "to": 46}, {"start": 4.341916, "end": 4.652041, "from": 48, "to": 51}, {"start": 4.666833, "end": 4.976958, "from": 52, "to": 57}, {"start": 4.99175, "end": 5.080375, "from": 58, "to": 60}, {"start": 5.095125, "end": 5.759708, "from": 61, "to": 70}, {"start": 5.774458, "end": 5.892624, "from": 71, "to": 72}, {"start": 5.907375, "end": 6.055041, "from": 73, "to": 75}, {"start": 6.069833, "end": 6.365208, "from": 76, "to": 80}, {"start": 6.379958, "end": 6.542416, "from": 81, "to": 83}, {"start": 6.557166, "end": 6.985457, "from": 84, "to": 90}, {"start": 7.00025, "end": 7.709125, "from": 91, "to": 100}, {"start": 8.728125, "end": 8.949666, "from": 102, "to": 104}, {"start": 8.964416, "end": 9.496082, "from": 105, "to": 112}, {"start": 9.510875, "end": 9.865333, "from": 113, "to": 117}, {"start": 9.880083, "end": 9.983458, "from": 118, "to": 120}, {"start": 9.998208, "end": 10.795708, "from": 121, "to": 130}, {"start": 11.81475, "end": 12.243041, "from": 132, "to": 139}, {"start": 12.257791, "end": 12.671291, "from": 140, "to": 146}, {"start": 12.686083, "end": 12.804249, "from": 147, "to": 149}, {"start": 12.819, "end": 13.158666, "from": 150, "to": 156}, {"start": 13.173458, "end": 13.350666, "from": 157, "to": 160}, {"start": 13.365416, "end": 